  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Craft - Tinkering</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><a href=\"/site/uocraft/uo_craft/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">ML크랩에대해서</font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20071201214006/http://www.forg.co.kr/uocraft/uo_knowhow_addon.html\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">\n</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">l&nbsp;</font></span><a href=\"/site/uocraft/uo_craft_1/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">크랩재료리스트</font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</font></span><a href=\"/site/uocraft/uo_craft_2/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">대장장이</font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/uocraft/uo_craft_3/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">테일러</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/uocraft/uo_craft_4/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">보우크래프트</font></a></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><a href=\"/site/uocraft/uo_craft_5/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">팅거링</font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            \n                             \n                            l&nbsp;</font></span><a href=\"/site/uocraft/uo_craft_6/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">목공술</font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l </font><a href=\"/site/uocraft/uo_craft_7/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">인스크립션</font></a></span></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#C9BA93\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"570\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"564\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"black\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"86%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"492\"> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\"></b></span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Pendant \n                                                    of the Magi</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"118\">\n<p align=\"center\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/uocraft/images/mlitem/cra_tt_1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"200\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:120/200\" width=\"120\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCCCC\" width=\"368\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지능추가(Intelligence \n                                                    Bonus)&nbsp;10</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">마나재생(Mana \n                                                    Regeneration) 3</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">주문피해증가(Spell \n                                                    Damage Increase)&nbsp;5% \n                                                    </span></font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">마나소비감소(Lower \n                                                    Mana Cost)&nbsp;10%</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">시약소모감소(Lower \n                                                    Reagent Cost) 30%</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"black\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC99\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"10\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/b_4.gif\" width=\"10\">Eye \n                                                    of the Travesty(1) <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"22\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/ingot.gif\" width=\"22\">Ingots(15)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/fishing.gif\" width=\"16\">White \n                                                    Pearl(5) <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"10\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/gem_stars.gif\" width=\"10\">Star \n                                                                Sapphires(50)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"492\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\"></b></span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Essence \n                                                    of Battle</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"118\">\n<p align=\"center\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"200\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/cra_tt_2.gif\" width=\"120\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCCCC\" width=\"368\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">힘추가(Strength \n                                                    Bonus) 7</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">민첩추가(Dexterity \n                                                    Bonus) 7</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">피해증가(Damage Increase)&nbsp;30%</span></font> </p><table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"black\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC99\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"26\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/b_3.gif\" width=\"24\">Captured \n                                                    Essence(1) &nbsp;<img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"22\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/ingot.gif\" width=\"22\">Ingots(2)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/m_4.gif\" width=\"16\">Fire \n                                                                Ruby \n                                                                <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"10\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/gem_ruby.gif\" width=\"10\">Rubies(50)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\" colspan=\"2\" width=\"492\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\"></b></span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Resilient \n                                                    Bracer</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"118\">\n<p align=\"center\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/uocraft/images/mlitem/cra_tt_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"200\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:120/200\" width=\"120\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCCCC\" width=\"368\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">마법저항(Resisting \n                                                    Spells) \n                                                    +15</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">체력증가(Hit Point Increase) 5</span></font> </p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">체력재생(Hit Point \nRegeneration) 2</span></font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#660000\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">방어성공률증가(Defense \n                                                    Chance Increase)5%</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물리적저항(Physical \n                                                    Resist) 14%</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"black\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC99\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"26\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/b_3.gif\" width=\"24\">Captured \n                                                    Essence(1) <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"22\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/ingot.gif\" width=\"22\">Ingots(2)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/m_1.gif\" width=\"16\">Blue \n                                                                Diamond&nbsp;<img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"10\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/gem_diamond.gif\" width=\"10\">Diamond(50)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">*아래 \n                                        반지와 팔찌는 주황색글씨의 옵션이 100%나오는게 \n                                        아니라 주로 \n                                        나온다는 의미이며</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">그이외 \n                                        부가옵들이 붙어서 해당옵에 +되거나 다른옵이 \n                                        랜덤하게 나오게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\"></b></span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Brilliant \n                                                    Amber Bracelet</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(팔찌-마법관련옵션)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#EC2E00\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">주문피해증가(Spell Damage Increase)</span></font>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><font color=\"#EC2E00\" face=\"Verdana\">빠른주문회복(Faster Cast Recovery)</font></span>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><font color=\"#EC2E00\" face=\"Verdana\">빠른주문시전(Faster Casting)</font></span>\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><font color=\"#EC2E00\" face=\"Verdana\">시약소모감소(Lower Reagents Cost)</font></span> </p><table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"black\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC99\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/lum_4.gif\" width=\"16\">Brilliant \n                                                                Amber(10) <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"10\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/gem_amber.gif\" width=\"10\">Amber(20) \n                                                                <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"22\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/ingot.gif\" width=\"22\">Ingots(5)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\"></b></span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Fire \n                                                    Ruby Bracelet</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(팔찌-불저항)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font color=\"#EC2E00\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">불저항(Fire \n                                                    Resist) 10%</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"black\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC99\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/m_4.gif\" width=\"16\">Fire \n                                                                Ruby(10) <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"10\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/gem_ruby.gif\" width=\"10\">Rubies(20)\n                                                                <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"22\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/mlitem/ingot.gif\" width=\"22\">Ingots(5)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin:0;\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#FFFFCC\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:14; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:14;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/uocraft/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\"></b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Ecru \n                                                    Citrine Ring</b>(반지-물약강화옵션)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\